# Nginx Proxy Manager hosts

List and craft proxy hosts, redirections, streams, SSL certificates, and access
lists. Prefer MCP when connected; else the product API or
authenticated UI.

Never invent proxy-host / certificate / access-list ids — list/resolve first.
Resolve the instance base URL from operator config — do not hardcode hosts.
After changes, report domain + scheme + upstream + SSL state (no tokens).
